</section>
<section id="A2.SS3.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Supervised Fine-Tuning.</h4>

<div id="A2.SS3.SSS0.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS3.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We perform supervised fine-tuning (SFT) using Llama-Factory <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib29" title="" class="ltx_ref">Zheng et al., 2024</a>)</cite> with hyperparameters shown in Table <a href="#A2.T3" title="Table 3 ‣ Supervised Fine-Tuning. ‣ B.3 Training Hyperparameters ‣ Appendix B Experiment Setup ‣ Can Large Language Models Develop Strategic Reasoning? Post-training Insights from Learning Chess" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>. Training loss is computed only on the model outputs, with input prompts masked. We fine-tune all models using 4 NVIDIA A100 80GB GPUs. A single training instance takes approximately 1 hour.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A2.T3" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 3: </span>Supervised fine-tuning hyperparameters.</figcaption>
