<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A4.F16.pic1.2.1.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">User: The current FEN string is 8/5k2/3p1q2/pp1PbQ2/1r2p3/8/PPP4n/1K3BR1 w - - 16 42 and legal moves are Qc8 Qh7+ Qd7+ Qg6+ Qxf6+ Qe6+ Qh5+ Qg5 Qxe5 Qg4 Qf4 Qxe4 Qh3 Qf3 Qf2 Rg8 Rg7+ Rg6 Rg5 Rg4 Rg3 Rg2 Rh1 Bxb5 Bc4 Bh3 Bd3 Bg2 Be2 Kc1 Ka1 c3 b3 a3 c4 a4. What is the best move to make out of the list of legal moves?
